{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/f017c28961aa5c77f81ba97dd67e705b.avif?t=1760374640\" width=1232 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/7e6bf220eecaec418962be5d76d52ac3.poster.avif?t=1760374640\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/7e6bf220eecaec418962be5d76d52ac3.webm?t=1760374640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/7e6bf220eecaec418962be5d76d52ac3.mp4?t=1760374640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelite bullet-heaven game, a rookie adventurer dies and gets &quot;hired&quot; to work for all his afterlife in an office of undead soul-collectors. Navigate through office death in this humorous narrative with addictive gameplay and a corporate culture that incentivizes you to break the game itself with overpowered combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/c7d6d79e735e0b2249fe8e79ec96be4c.avif?t=1760374640\" width=1232 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/429d08dcba6f82a8aac559b7da6a06ac.avif?t=1760374640\" width=1232 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress like the veterans at your workplace while they push their work on you and engage with magical managers who will belittle your efforts. Experience eternal corporate damnation together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/ece0877877225c5ea64e38dfc2fab6f8.avif?t=1760374640\" width=1232 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/01123c594ce5cd303ebee121dc09ccd4.gif?t=1760374640\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/01123c594ce5cd303ebee121dc09ccd4.poster.avif?t=1760374640\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your immortal toil, you can invest your own pay into improving your talents, and more importantly, invest all collected souls into growing our corporation! Improve the lobby, the furniture, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/81f82278b94d26c37c15adde6b160a51.avif?t=1760374640\" width=1232 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/04f3e84ab28c063536b046112150bf04.poster.avif?t=1760374640\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/04f3e84ab28c063536b046112150bf04.webm?t=1760374640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/04f3e84ab28c063536b046112150bf04.mp4?t=1760374640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our workplace culture is not the only dynamic thing here, but also the conditions at each map location! Random weather conditions will add to the chaos of your work routine by altering the chance of specific boons and enemies appearing during a run, while giving you strategic responsibility to adapt diverse builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/6dafa58aecd2af4dc6bbe32033f18b2f.avif?t=1760374640\" width=1232 height=136 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unified Currency: all your efforts reaping souls will earn you E-Scrips, our patented currency that can be used for transactions within the company and literally nowhere else!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unrelenting Business Growth: grow alongside the company by spending your own pay on new things!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patented Exclusive Boons: weapons, spells, gadgets, and even cute plushies. We spare almost no expenses to improve your run!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no dental plan, sorry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/171c387cf83a51c4d47c98ff6ddfb0cb.avif?t=1760374640\" width=1232 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love our game? Hate working in an office and want to vent? We got the perfect place for you! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2671450?t=1760374640","background_raw":"https://store.akamai