ons: weapons, spells, gadgets, and even cute plushies. We spare almost no expenses to improve your run!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no dental plan, sorry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/extras/171c387cf83a51c4d47c98ff6ddfb0cb.avif?t=1760374640\" width=1232 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love our game? Hate working in an office and want to vent? We got the perfect place for you! </p>","developers":["JohnnyR Designs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671450/4fab9838cb8bc2b6583649e6b69879682f97aff5/header.jpg?t=1760374640","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2671450/719232523/8104e6a6044ed46bea45678429f0eec1e82b32d2/1750941770/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749450960","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2671450/719232523/8104e6a6044ed46bea45678429f0eec1e82b32d2/1750941770/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749450960","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2671450/719232523/8104e6a6044ed46bea45678429f0eec1e82b32d2/1750941770/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749450960","id":257153867,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153867/movie480.mp4?t=1749450960","max":"https://video.akamai.stea